      "prov:value": "Authored in cat-harness#1396 (2026-11-23): models end-to-end swarm decomposition, per-swarm spawn permission/waiver gate, isolated-worktree worker dispatch, reactive + 2-to-4-minute fallback Swarm Monitor sweeps, merge-steward handoff, shared beans slot refill, and clean Process_BeanClose completion.",
