      "cat-harness:section": "Task_InitOrClaimSwarmEpic",
      "prov:value": "Owner directives (2026-11-24, PR #1397): starting any swarm binds to a parent Swarm Work Item (epic or milestone in beans, parameterized over any swarm goal — with 'Stability' as one concrete example alongside research, proof-closure, detangling, literature-audit, and outreach swarms) carrying explicit acceptance criteria / end state, structured child work-item queues, user-selectable on-demand vs periodic status reporting, and a live Cold-Start Handover Runbook kept synced on every check-in through Process_SwarmMonitorSweep so any successor coordinator or merge manager can take over cold when a session stalls.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
